        case Red(r) => "Red = ${r}"
        case Green(g) where g < 0 => "Green = 0" // Matched.
        case Green(g) => "Green = ${g}"
        case Blue(b) where b < 0 => "Blue = 0"
        case Blue(b) => "Blue = ${b}"
    }
    print(cs)
}
```

编译执行上述代码，输出结果为：

```text
Green = 0
```

